  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AR-Provincial Maternal-Child Health Investment Project  (1st. phase APL)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed loan is an integral part of the Government of Argentina&apos;s poverty reduction program and aims to support the implementation of the Maternal and Child Health Insurance Program.  The project will contribute to: (a) stop the increase in infant mortality and further reduce it; (b) support the implementation of a significant change in health service contracting and management at provincial levelcomma and (c) strengthen the stewardship capacity of the national and provincial ministries of health.</narrative>
  </description>
